{"id":"me_che","lemma":"mèche","pos":"noun","rank":4014,"glosses":["wick (of candle)","fuse (of a bomb)","lock, tuft (of hair); streak (of colour, etc., in hair)"],"ipa":"/mɛʃ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5a/Fr-m%C3%A8che.ogg/Fr-m%C3%A8che.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"mèches"},"examples":[{"text":"Est-ce que j'ai vendu la mèche ?","en":"Did I blow it?","words":[{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"corrupt"},{"g":"the / her"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"what"]]},{"text":"Ne vend pas la mèche.","en":"Don't spill the beans.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"to sell","l":"vendre"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Une mèche de cheveux tomba devant son œil gauche.","en":"A wisp of hair fell over his left eye.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a headhair","l":"cheveu"},{"g":"to fall","l":"tomber"},{"g":"in front of"},{"g":"his, her, its"},{"g":"eye"},{"g":"left"}]},{"text":"Tom a vendu la mèche.","en":"Tom let the cat out of the bag.","words":[null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"corrupt"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Tom allait mentir, mais il a fini par vendre la mèche.","en":"Tom was going to lie, but he ended up spilling the beans.","words":[null,{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},{"g":"to lie"},{"g":"but"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to finish","l":"finir"},{"g":"through"},{"g":"to sell"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}